## Module 3：modal 追问对话补充流式渲染（P1 核心交互缺口）

### 证据
- 行 5314–5321：`appendDialogV2` 一次性插入用户+AI 两条消息，无流式、无过渡
- 行 5358–5363：`handleFollowV2` 同步直接调用 `appendDialogV2`，没有"思考中"过渡状态
- 行 4508–4525：`streamBubbleCopyV2` 已实现流式逐字渲染，有 `tick` 机制可复用

### 改动

**步骤 A**：在 `appendDialogV2`（行 5314）之前插入通用流式渲染函数：
```js
function streamIntoElement(targetEl, text, options) {
  const speed = (options && options.speed) || 22;
  const onDone = (options && options.onDone) || function() {};
  let index = 0;
  targetEl.textContent = "";
  const tick = function() {
    index += Math.max(1, text[index] === " " ? 2 : 1);
    targetEl.textContent = text.slice(0, index);
    if (index < text.length) {
      window.setTimeout(tick, speed);
    } else {
      onDone();
    }
  };
  window.setTimeout(tick, 30);
}
```

**步骤 B**：将 `appendDialogV2` 改造为两个函数，替换原实现：
```js
function appendUserTurnV2(userText) {
  const thread = document.getElementById("dialog-thread-v2");
  if (!thread) return;
  thread.insertAdjacentHTML("beforeend",
    '<div class="chat-bubble user">' + escapeHtmlV2(userText) + '</div>');
  thread.scrollTop = thread.scrollHeight;
}

function appendAiTurnStreamingV2(replyText) {
  const thread = document.getElementById("dialog-thread-v2");
  if (!thread) return;
  const thinkingId = "thinking-" + Date.now();
  thread.insertAdjacentHTML("beforeend",
    '<div class="chat-bubble ai thinking" id="' + thinkingId + '">' +
    '<span class="thinking-dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></div>');
  thread.scrollTop = thread.scrollHeight;
  const delay = 500 + Math.floor(Math.random() * 500);
  window.setTimeout(function() {
    const el = document.getElementById(thinkingId);
    if (!el) return;
    el.classList.remove("thinking");
    el.innerHTML = "";
    streamIntoElement(el, replyText, {
      speed: 22,
      onDone: function() { thread.scrollTop = thread.scrollHeight; }
    });
  }, delay);
}
```

**步骤 C**：修改 `handleFollowV2`（行 5358）：
```js
